    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19632" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Glauce</span></b> , ēs, f.,
		= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γλαύκη</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The mother of the third Diana</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D.
				3, 23, 58</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Another name of Creüsa</i>, <i>wife of Jason</i>, <i><span class="en">Hyg. F.
			25</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>An Amazon</i>, <i><span class="en">Hyg. F.
			163</span></i>.</div>
